title Spike 16: trucks
about Storage that moves. Blue.0's three energy trucks add 15,000 to its storage, and its income fills it; given to blue.1, each takes a full load with it (watch the energy lines), and blue.1 drives them forward and digs them in as vaults. 4 minutes at 8x.

scenario economy
players blue 2
clip 0..7200
speed 8
camera 150,256 220
bot blue.0 off                       # blue.0 is a person: the script plays it

at 0 spawn blue.0 generator 8 at 40,200 radius 14

at 1200 select blue factory as plant
at 1201 produce plant energy-truck 3

at 4800 select blue energy-truck as trucks
at 4801 give trucks to 1
at 4802 select blue.1 energy-truck as theirs  # blue.1's now: only blue.1 orders them
at 4830 move theirs 180,256
at 5700 give blue.0 metal 600 to 1    # digging in costs metal, and blue.1's bot spends all it has
at 5701 entrench theirs

# Observed: before the give, blue.0 has 25,000 energy (its 10,000 and the
# trucks' 15,000 of room, filled); just after, blue.0 10,000 and blue.1
# about 25,000. By 6500 all three are vaults: blue.1 keeps the room.
at 4799 expect blue.0 energy >= 24000
at 4799 expect blue.0 energy-trucks == 3
at 4803 expect blue.0 energy <= 10000
at 4803 expect blue.1 energy >= 24000
at 4803 expect blue.1 energy-trucks == 3
at 6500 expect blue.1 energy-vaults == 3
at 6500 expect blue.1 energy > 10000
at 6600 select blue.1 energy-vault within 25 of 180,256 as dug
at 6601 expect dug alive == 3          # dug in where blue.1 drove them
